What:		/sys/class/net/pon0/device/bosa_thresholds
Date:		October 2026
Contact:	Linux PON developers <netdev@vger.kernel.org>
Description:
		The optical module's own alarm and warning thresholds for
		transmit and receive power, read from SFF-8472 A2h bytes
		0x18-0x27 as the calibration blob programmed them. Values are in
		nW, like bosa_ddm:

		tx_alarm_high_nw tx_alarm_low_nw tx_warn_high_nw tx_warn_low_nw
		rx_alarm_high_nw rx_alarm_low_nw rx_warn_high_nw rx_warn_low_nw

		Reads fail with EAGAIN until the module has been programmed.
